The {{Term/Store|Trousers of the Wild||Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} are a recurring item in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/> The Trousers of the Wild go unnamed in {{SSBU}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Trousers of the Wild are a piece of [[Armor]] that can be obtained as part of the titular gift in the "[[A Gift from the Monks]]" [[Side Quest]]. After completing all 120 of the [[Ancient Shrine]]s, excluding the 16 Shrines that must be completed in the "[[EX The Champions' Ballad]]" [[Main Quest]], the [[Monk]] of the final Shrine will tell [[Link]] to go the [[Forgotten Temple]],<ref name="BotW Monk"/> where he will find three stone [[Treasure Chest]]s in front of the [[Goddess Statue]] at the back of the Temple. The Chest on the right contains the Trousers of the Wild. The Trousers of the Wild can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Trousers of the Wild, alongside the [[Cap of the Wild]] and the [[Tunic of the Wild]], compose the [[Wild Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides a Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]].

